/span><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>内容塔的输入不是单一模态。一条带货短视频至少能提供四路信号：关键帧的视觉特征（商品外观、场景）、ASR 转写文本（口播里念出的品类与卖点）、画面 OCR 文本（字幕与贴片里的品牌词、价格）、以及标题与话题标签。四路信号需要融合成一个内容向量，最简单可靠的做法是&quot;分词路各出一个向量、拼接后过一层投影&quot;，而不是早期就把原始特征丢进一个大模型——分路独立更新让换掉任意一路的信号不至于重训全塔（来源：用大规模图文对训练共享跨模态表征的可行性，见 Radford et al., &quot;Learning Transferable Visual Models From Natural Language Supervision&quot;（CLIP）, 2021, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.00020）。\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.00020）。</a></p>\n<p>商品塔的输入相对干净：标题、类目树路径、属性 KV、主图向量。这里的坑在于<strong>类目树本身就是一层很强的先验</strong>，如果商品向量里类目占比过高，召回会退化成&quot;同类目随机商品&quot;，失去区分度。实践上通常把类目做成召回阶段的过滤条件而不是向量的一部分。</p>\n<p>召回结束后还有一道重排，用来解决&quot;高相似但不可卖&quot;的问题：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>CTR</mtext><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Risk</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>PriceGap</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">score(c, i) = \\alpha \\cdot s(c,i) + \\beta \\cdot \\text{CTR}_{pred}(c,i) - \\gamma \\cdot \\text{Risk}(i) - \\delta \\cdot \\text{PriceGap}(c,i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CTR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Risk</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PriceGap</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Risk</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Risk}(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Risk</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 惩罚有资质问题、历史投诉率高、当前处于处罚期的商品，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PriceGap</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PriceGap}(c,i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PriceGap</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 惩罚视频里口播的价格与商品实际售价明显不符的情况——这是自动关联里客诉率最高的一类错误，用户在视频里听到&quot;9 块 9&quot;，点进去是 99 块。这一项在跨境场景里还要叠加币种与税费口径的归一化，见 <a href=\"../feed-global/multilingual-content-match\">多语言内容与用户匹配</a>。</p>\n<p>自动匹配的产出<strong>不应该直接对外曝光</strong>。稳妥的路径是三级：置信度高于高阈值且商品风险分低 → 直接生效但计入可回滚批次；置信度居中 → 进入创作者待确认队列，创作者确认后才生效（这就是前面表格里的软挂载）；置信度低 → 只作为排序特征与内容理解标签，不生成任何购买入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关联的生命周期与断链治理\">关联的生命周期与断链治理</h2><p>关联不是&quot;建好就完事&quot;的记录，它是一个有状态、会过期、必须主动清理的对象。典型状态机是：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; pending&#10;  pending --&gt; active: 审核通过&#10;  pending --&gt; rejected: 审核拒绝&#10;  active --&gt; paused: 商品缺货/价格异常&#10;  active --&gt; expired: 超过 effective_to&#10;  active --&gt; banned: 商品违规下架&#10;  paused --&gt; active: 恢复正常&#10;  rejected --&gt; [*]&#10;  expired --&gt; [*]&#10;  banned --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; pending\n  pending --&gt; active: 审核通过\n  pending --&gt; rejected: 审核拒绝\n  active --&gt; paused: 商品缺货/价格异常\n  active --&gt; expired: 超过 effective_to\n  active --&gt; banned: 商品违规下架\n  paused --&gt; active: 恢复正常\n  rejected --&gt; [*]\n  expired --&gt; [*]\n  banned --&gt; [*]</pre><p>真正需要工程投入的是从 <code>active</code> 出去的每一条边。<strong>商品缺货</strong>是最频繁的中断源：一个爆款视频带火商品后 48 小时内售罄，如果关联还停在 <code>active</code>，系统就会持续把流量导到一个买不到货的页面。这需要商品侧的库存变更事件实时驱动关联状态，而不是等定时任务扫描——定时扫描的窗口期正好是流量峰值期。<strong>价格异常</strong>同理，尤其是大促前后的价格跳动，需要有阈值规则（如价格变动超过 30% 自动 <code>paused</code> 并通知创作者）。<strong>商品违规下架</strong>必须级联到关联，否则治理侧的处罚会被内容流持续绕过——治理域的规则见 <a href=\"../social-virality/viral-abuse-guard\">裂变防刷与诱导分享合规</a>。</p>\n<p>&quot;断链&quot;是另一个必须主动监控的指标：关联存在、状态是 <code>active</code>、但商品接口返回 404 或下架。它产生的原因是跨系统的最终一致性窗口，表现出来却是用户点进去白屏。治理办法是给关联服务加一个对账任务，周期性抽样拉取商品状态并与本地状态比对，把不一致率作为核心 SLO 之一。这个指标通常比关联总量更能反映系统的实际健康度——关联量是虚荣指标，有效关联率才是。</p>\n<p>最后一个常被低估的问题是<strong>关联的可解释性</strong>。当创作者申诉&quot;我的佣金少了&quot;、商家投诉&quot;我的商品被挂到不相关内容上&quot;、或监管要求说明&quot;这个推荐位为什么展示这个商品&quot;时，系统必须能回答：这条关联是谁在什么时候、通过哪种途径、按哪套规则建立的。这意味着关联记录不能只存当前状态，还要存一份不可变的创建与变更审计日志。可解释、可追溯、可回滚这三条要求在本 hub 的每一章都会反复出现，关联服务是它们第一次落地的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>关联记录是一等实体，独立于内容与商品两侧存在；不要在任何一侧的表上挂对方的 ID 数组，那会制造反向依赖。</li>\n<li>四种关联途径（硬挂载、软挂载、自动匹配、集合关联）可信度与覆盖面互不相同，判断标准是&quot;每个曝光出去的入口能否追溯到责任主体、能否明确失效&quot;。</li>\n<li>数据模型的关键取舍在三处：<code>sku_scope</code> 要显式到有货 SKU、<code>position</code> 由关联侧统一管理、自动匹配必须带 <code>confidence</code> 并参与曝光门槛。</li>\n<li>查询分两种形态：按内容查走缓存，按商品反查走异步物化倒排；混在一个同步接口里是性能事故的常见来源。</li>\n<li>自动匹配的产出要三级分流（直接生效 / 创作者确认 / 只做特征），并且必须对&quot;口播价格与实际售价不符&quot;这类错误单独惩罚。</li>\n<li>生命周期里最需要投入的是 <code>active</code> 向外的四条边，尤其库存与价格事件的实时驱动，以及治理处罚到关联的级联。</li>\n<li>用&quot;有效关联率&quot;而不是&quot;关联总量&quot;衡量健康度，并为每条关联保留不可变的审计日志。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关联记录解决的是&quot;这条内容能卖什么&quot;，把它变成用户真正能点的入口，还需要一套卡片形态与混排策略，见 <a href=\"feed-card-types\">短视频/图文/商品卡混排</a>；关联本身要能持续产生，取决于创作者有没有动力去挂车，这取决于分佣机制，见 <a href=\"creator-commerce\">创作者带货与分佣</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内容与商品的关联绑定","id":"内容与商品的关联绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：关联是把内容资产映射到商品成交单元","id":"核心概念-关联是把内容资产映射到商品成交单元"},{"level":2,"text":"关联记录的数据模型","id":"关联记录的数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"自动关联：多模态理解与商品向量召回","id":"自动关联-多模态理解与商品向量召回"},{"level":2,"text":"关联的生命周期与断链治理","id":"关联的生命周期与断链治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"短视频/图文/商品卡混排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/social-feed-commerce/feed-commerce-model/feed-card-types"}}